---
description: Testing and definition of done
alwaysApply: true
---
- Definition of Done per screen: real endpoints, all states, a11y AA, responsive, tests, traceability row updated, RBAC + audit verified.
- Backend: unit + Testcontainers integration for each endpoint (happy, 401/403/404, validation). Critical modules ≥ 90% branch coverage on decision logic.
- Mandatory suites: AI-boundary tests, RLS isolation tests, role-map equality, PII-log scrub, OpenAPI-vs-catalogue diff.
- Use synthetic data only. Gateway stub with recorded fixtures in CI; live model calls only in weekly eval jobs.
